                <invention-title lang="de">RADANORDNUNG MIT SENSOR ZUR MESSUNG DER RADBEWEGUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">ENSEMBLE ROUE AVEC CAPTEUR POUR MESURER LE MOUVEMENT DE LA ROUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">WHEEL ASSEMBLY WITH SENSOR FOR MEASURING WHEEL MOVEMENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Accordingly to an aspect of the invention, there is provided a wheel assembly (130) including a sensor for measuring wheel movement comprising: a frame member (136); an axle (140) fixed to the frame member (136); a wheel (132) rotatably mounted to the axle (140), wherein the wheel (132) comprises a wheel recess (137); a code ring (190) located within the wheel recess (137) for rotation with the wheel (132); and a sensor device (300) coupled to the frame member (136) and located adjacent to the code ring (190), wherein the sensor device (300) senses movement of the code ring (190) and generates an output signal indicative of the wheel movement. The frame member (136) comprises opposing axle plates (144, 146) for supporting the axle (140), each of the opposing axle plates (144, 146) comprising a bore (144A, 146A) formed therethrough for receiving the axle (140). One of the opposing axle plates (144, 146) comprises a further bore (147) through which a portion of the sensor device (300) at least partially extends. The wheel assembly (130) further comprises a side member (180, 400) that is coupled to the one axle plate (144, 146) and comprises a cavity (182) or an opening (404) that receives and at least partially encloses the sensor device (300).</p>
            </abstract>
